# plans/BUILD_AND_DEPENDENCY_SYSTEM_REDESIGN.md §4.6: `yo test --workspace` runs
# every member's tests in ONE run, with a single summary rather than one per
# member.
#
# Both members carry a test; the third member (`examples/demo`) carries none,
# which is why the total is 2 — a member without tests contributes nothing
# rather than failing. Order is the sorted member order, so the report is
# stable across platforms (raw readdir order is not).
timeout=600
stdout_keep=^(  ✓|[0-9]+ (passed|failed|total))
